WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:30.400
The attack of the Buff Clan aliens was
not focused merely on the Ideon.

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:38.360
In order to rescue Karala Ajiba, they also attacked
the spaceship that was buried in the ground.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:46.040
However, the buried Sixth Civilization
spaceship rose from the ground.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:55.300
A spaceship emerged from
 the ground? What the?!

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:56.550
Why is this happening?

00:01:56.550 --> 00:02:02.550
<b>Escape from Planet Solo</b>

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:11.730
The enemies are fleeing?

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:14.020
You won't escape!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.410
Techno, Kasha! Fire! Fire!

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.410
We can't allow them to get away!

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.870
I'm trying to! This computer panel is malfunctioning!

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.630
Shake them off!

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:38.800
Not bad!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:51.980
Where'd they go?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.110
So you don't know why it's operational?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:02.160
The antimatter engine and the
normal engine are still being adjusted!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.030
Damn it!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.870
My lady! It seems the tremors broke the lock.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.120
It looks like an ancient electronic lock,
 so the power was most likely cut off.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.420
Lady!

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:30.140
It's flying in the air...

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.140
No way...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.230
Hey, you two, that's dangerous!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.900
You could fall out, come over here!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.650
This ship is flying?!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.280
If you're in the military, you
should know why we're flying!

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:44.110
That man, what is he talking about?

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.160
I wonder...

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:53.960
We're falling!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.630
Everyone! Hold on to something!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.260
We've landed! Hurry and inspect every section!

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:12.140
This spaceship moved...! This spaceship...!

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:24.150
The missile controls are functioning,
so why aren't we chasing the enemy?

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:27.780
We don't understand the Ideon well enough yet.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.830
Defeating the enemy should come first!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.500
That artifact is moving!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:35.420
If that's a spaceship, we could use it as a weapon!

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.510
Recover the Ideon! Get it resupplied and repaired!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:42.670
You can do it.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:43.550
Huh?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.430
Judging from the aliens' fierce resistance
and the weapons they possess,

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.140
I'd say they appear to be very hostile.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.350
That might be the case.

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:59.230
I don't think such race would
treat prisoners in a humane manner.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.440
What are you getting at?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.360
Mayaya's position signal has vanished.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.110
We should launch a full scale attack at once.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:11.790
No. If the aliens are on our level, they
won't kill their prisoners immediately.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.120
You can't figure out their thoughts
just from the way they look.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.420
If we provoke the enemy with another
attack, it might backfire on us.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:22.340
Lady Karala is an intelligent person.
 She wouldn't be easily captured.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.130
I'm sick of your optimistic views.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.840
We'll sortie once the Heavy
 Mobile Mecha are operational.

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:31.260
Until then, the both of you just wait.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:31.600
Yes sir.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.570
Okay! Very good!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.440
Roger.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.570
Now I just have to transform Sol
Amber into the Ideo-Delta somehow...

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.120
Is the Glen Cannon output good enough?

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.370
Yes. The Normal Engine is enough to power them.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:05:59.920
Okay!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:04.550
All right!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:09.510
It seems that the back portion can only
transform in midair, wouldn't you say?

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:14.140
The Ideon can separate into 3 machines.
We can't keep it combined all the time.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:18.140
Can the Ideo-Buster be used for aerial combat too?

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:21.610
It should be versatile enough. More
importantly, you should get some rest.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:25.230
Everyone's been killed! I don't have time to sleep!

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.820
You can't do anything if you push
yourself too hard. Go to bed.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.750
Lou, don't! You'll get dirty.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.210
You have to drink more milk.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.380
It's a miracle something like spinach
could have grown inside a cavern...

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:47.130
Attention 16th floor! The dome is closing!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.680
Somehow, our situation doesn't
 feel completely hopeless now.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.180
Right, Lou?

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.770
You want to escape from planet Solo?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:08.740
Now that aliens have found this planet,
 I don't think it's safe to live here.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.400
You want to turn your tail and run?

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:12.860
Could we do it?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.160
This spaceship could move.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.080
We just need to set the DS Drive
to the proper coordinates.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:23.630
But it's possible for the enemy to use DS
Drive to chase us into sub-space, right?

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:27.210
Do you always have to think
 in such a pessimistic manner?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:27.880
I hate it.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:31.930
Ashura! Lou! Fard! I've brought a cow!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.010
Ashura!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.100
Lou!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.220
Ashura!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:42.020
Fard says he wants to go back to his mama.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.230
But...! Where's Lou?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:45.310
Lou!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:46.690
Lou!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:48.400
Lou!

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.110
I'm sorry.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.780
That's a healthy looking baby.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:54.820
I'm sorry.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.330
Your outfit is really beautiful.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.280
Thank you.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.080
They must be from the third group of colonists.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.080
So that kind of look is popular on Earth?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.000
Lady, we should escape from here!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.760
Don't you think these trees are strange?

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.430
Trees?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:19.810
It seems that this spaceship has been buried
for centuries, yet this tree is still growing.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.390
Doesn't that seem odd?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.480
Could it have something to do with the Ide?

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.270
But...

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.070
Cosmo! How is your battle suit?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.110
It's so stiff, it feels uncomfortable.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.450
You can't be wearing cashmere, you know.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.320
That suit will help suppress the launch shock.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.910
Ah, is that so?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.500
Ideo-Nova! Ideo-Buster! Launch!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.960
Glen Cannon, test fire! Target: Fujiyama!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.510
Fire!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.300
It isn't very accurate.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:02.100
Yes. It deviated 3 degrees to the left.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:06.100
Even so, this Sixth Civilization machine
 has great power and performance!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.440
The missiles on the feet have moved below? Why?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.990
In Sol-Conver form, they're moved aside.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.200
Isn't there anything in front?

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.330
There are 8 missile launchers in front.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:21.870
These?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:22.370
Yes.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:27.580
When we've transformed into the
Ideon, can they be fired from here?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.500
We can't control them all.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.290
How can I aim them?

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.590
We can use these 10 monitors
to target multiple enemies at once.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.550
I have to look at 10 monitors at the same time?

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.180
Well, this is real combat!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.930
There will be people inside to
 help us with the cannons, though.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.010
Enter docking formation!

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.650
Kasha! Keep your position fixed!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:55.530
Impossible! I've only flown light jets before!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.740
If you get yourself killed, it's not my problem!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.200
That Kasha! Serves her right!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.000
Sir Damido, is it alright
 to head out in advance?

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:14.590
I need to teach Sir Abadede
that I'm different from Gije.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:15.550
Yes.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.260
Lady Karala's hindrance isn't a problem.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.180
I just need to find her before Gije does.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:26.640
If I do that, Supreme Commander Doba and
Lady Harulu will have to improve their opinion on me.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.400
Why didn't you stop Damido?!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.530
We received his takeoff orders only a moment ago.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.570
The power of that Giant can't be
understood without witnessing it in person!

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:46.080
It's fine. Let him learn his lesson.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:51.120
But Sir Abadede, that Giant
has the armor of a warship.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.210
In that case, we'll have to send reinforcements.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.040
Will you please permit me to go?

00:10:55.040 --> 00:11:00.010
I don't like to waste resources on calling
 back units that already have been sent out.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:03.140
However, Damido will be severly punished later.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.510
Take command with the Gil Bau.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.680
Thank you very much.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.190
Don't concern yourself too much with Karala, Gije.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.230
Why?

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.190
You see, I... Never mind, just go.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.960
If you see the signal flare, come assist me.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:33.420
Yes sir.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.770
Is that the aliens' ship?

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.960
Is this a spaceship?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:24.130
It couldn't be! At this scale it
couldn't take off from the ground.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.050
That might be impossible with our level of technology.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:33.480
Good! The normal engine's at 80% output. Let's go!

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.110
It's moving!

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:49.240
It seems they aren't using their main engine...

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.380
Looks like they're returning towards the city.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:01.880
Damn it. What if Lady Karala is aboard?

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:05.340
Let's order the Dekka Baus to attack.
Meanwhile, we can sneak inside.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.430
No, hold on.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.100
It bothers me that the Giant they mentioned
isn't around. Let's wait for a while longer.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.980
The chickens! Don't let them run away!

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.610
Will this take me to the bridge?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.360
I think so.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:30.990
Lady Karala.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.080
I wonder if this suits your taste.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.330
Looks like these are your emergency rations.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.080
Thank you.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.420
Ah! It may be poisonous!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.380
It tastes like <i>creson</i>. I like it.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:41.960
That is...!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:42.710
Is that a <i>toram</i>?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.260
I'll try it.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:47.380
Well?

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:52.560
It's just like <i>toram</i>. I don't know
 what meat this is, but it's tender.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.310
It's a bit spicy.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.270
Yes.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.440
This ship...

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:05.400
If it's an ancient relic like they say,
 it might be related to the Ide.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:06.940
Lou! Lou!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.990
Lou! That's dirty!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.410
What is it, Ashura?

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:15.200
He's drinking from the goat's udders!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.170
Hey! Who's the commander of this ship?

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:19.870
It doesn't have one.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:24.000
Since our general headquarters were
destroyed, we have no idea what to do.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.380
We're going to escape from
Planet Solo. Everyone agreed on that.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.550
But the ones attacking us are aliens, right?

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.840
Are we going to just ignore them?

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:33.430
We can't escape otherwise.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.180
Joliver! Who is this woman?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:39.640
She knows this ship better than anyone else. That's all.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.020
They've come! The enemy!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.270
The enemy? From where?

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.230
Radar operator, what were you doing?

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.150
We can't use the radar.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.190
I see something in front of us!

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:50.280
Maybe the Ideon met up with the enemy.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.160
Seems so.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.570
Get the supplies loaded fast.
Prepare the engine!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:55.490
What's that?

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.040
It's not our squad.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:01.710
Over there?

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.000
We were in the middle of training!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.800
Artillery group! What should I do?

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:12.050
Rise and circle around them!
Shouldn't that work?

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:12.760
Shit!

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.180
Go up!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.140
Don't you care if you get hit by the enemy?

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.230
I've got them! Missiles!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:26.020
Cosmo! If you're in danger, just tell me!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:27.480
Mind your own business!

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:31.530
Pay attention to your surroundings!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.450
All units!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.030
Focus your attack on the unit in the back!

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.620
We can get data if we shoot down even one of them!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:51.130
Gije's unit might have encountered the Giant.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:54.930
Our squad will attack the spaceship. Biras!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:55.760
Roger!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.230
Dekka Baus!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.570
Lady Karala, get inside!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:11.780
The children!

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:12.450
Run!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:15.950
What are you doing?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.170
This is hopeless! Amateurs can't
stand up to pros in a dogfight!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:35.510
The Ideo-Buster?

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.810
The left leg's engine is hit!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.180
What can we do?

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.350
We need to dock!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.390
That's easy to say!

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.270
The Ideon Gauge?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.860
Concentrate on attacking the back unit!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.440
Don't let it turn into the Giant!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.410
We won't last like this, Kasha!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.910
It's that sign again!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.240
Ideon's...

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:02.370
Docking mark!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.210
Alright! Let's go!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:14.970
Ascend! Launch all the missiles!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:15.680
Fire! Fire!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.140
I got them...

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:42.120
All right! Kasha, hurry if you
don't want to get shot down!

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:48.540
I'm doing my best! I can't transform
 unless I take down at least one of them!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.380
It's transforming into the Giant!

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:58.550
To endure this much damage, they must have a barrier...

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.390
A powerful barrier!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.850
But we managed to damage it at least a little.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.720
There must be a way!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.860
The eye! Aim for the eye!
That must be the control center!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:29.750
Damido's unit! Do you hear me?
The Giant is impaired!

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.420
Aid us in our attack!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.790
Sir Damido! What should we do?

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.920
We can't disobey orders any more.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:38.260
Cooperate with them!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.770
Are they launching a concentrated attack on the Ideon?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:47.680
Seems so.

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.980
Okay, let's go help! Pilot!

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:50.730
It's impossible.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:54.820
What can the spaceship do without proper weapons?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.940
Sheryl, we're soldiers...

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.940
I'm a civilian!

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:03.950
It's absurd to send the civilians
on this ship to a futile death.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.200
No! You're so harsh, Sheryl!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.910
Kids, look away!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.120
We're worried about Cosmo and Kasha.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.380
We can't watch friends die!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:16.420
This ship doesn't have sufficient strength!
What are we supposed to do?

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.050
But...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.260
But... It could work out somehow...

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:33.980
Cosmo! Move the Ideon!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:36.440
How? The legs aren't working!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.940
The balancer got damaged!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.490
Kasha! Do something!

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.280
I'm trying everything I can, but...

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.490
Don't take me so lightly!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.620
Damn it!

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.090
The legs! Aim for the Giant's legs!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:08.010
We can't all survive if this goes on!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:10.560
Is the engine working? Give it a try!

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:11.520
The Ideon!

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.440
Okay, launch!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.730
How are you planning to fight?

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:24.320
What is this light?

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.280
I haven't seen a reaction like this before!

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:44.630
Our energy's not rising! What's wrong?

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:48.100
It's like Sir Gije said!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.890
Good. We'll take them out.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.520
Enemy to the left!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:03.360
Now they decide to show up!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.860
The spaceship's calling us.

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.320
Look! The power is rising!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.290
Okay! Let's jump onto that spaceship!

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.040
Let's go!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.520
What is this?!

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.170
Damn aliens! They used an antimatter engine!

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.580
Sir Damido!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.630
Are they escaping?!

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:24.940
Inside that ship, Lady Karala...

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:27.990
Could she be in there?

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:42.710
In the end, it seemed like the spacecraft named
 the Solo Ship had vanished into the blue sky.

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:58.560
<i>Karala meets with Gije who has snuck
near the Solo Ship, but she refuses to return.</i>

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:03.770
<i>Bes seizes the two of them and learns
the legend of the mysterious energy, Ide.</i>

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:08.690
<i>The battle begins anew, and
 Karala runs into the middle of it.</i>

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:14.720
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon:
"Infinite Power - The Legend of Ide."</i>

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:17.370
